WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.630
I stared at the same patch of sky for years, watching thousands of stars at once.

2
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:15.350
When a star dimmed a tiny bit, a planet was passing in front of it.

3
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.330
That's how I found thousands of worlds.

4
00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:29.430
When my steering wheels broke, my team used the push of sunlight to balance me. I said goodnight in 2018.

5
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:34.680
I stared at one patch of sky and found thousands of worlds.
